12	     body default below — resolve to Geist, with a graceful system fallback. */
13	  --font-sans: var(--font-nx-sans), ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
14	  --font-mono: var(--font-nx-mono), ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", "Menlo", monospace;
15	
16	  /* Nexion's palette used to live HERE, in the bare theme — reusing
17	     production's own slot names (brand-*, navy-*, accent-*) plus a slate-*
18	     override Tailwind's stock scale never had in production at all. Since
19	     `@theme` custom properties cascade like any other CSS variable, that
20	     meant every one of the ~4,700 existing `bg-brand-500`/`text-slate-300`/
21	     etc. usages sitewide picked up the new values — including marketing,
22	     login, and admin, none of which were ever meant to change. Confirmed
23	     live: "buttons changed, motion graphics changed" on pages whose own
24	     files were byte-identical to production, because the shared color
25	     UNDERNEATH those unchanged files had moved.
26	
27	     Fix: these slots stay at production's original values here, and the
28	     Nexion values move to `.nx-shell-root` below (the wrapper every
