730	/* .card-on itself is excluded above (it keeps its own rainbow rim in both
731	   themes), but its DARK #04214f fill — fine floating among other dark cards —
732	   reads as a jarring solid-navy hole punched into an otherwise all-white plan
733	   grid in light mode ("the highlight card is not look good"). Keep the same
734	   travelling conic-gradient rim (the part that actually reads as "selected")
735	   and swap only the fill and glow for a light surface. */
