2638	     The route-segment loading state (components/nx/Preloader). CSS-only on
2639	     purpose: it is on screen precisely while the page's own JavaScript is not
2640	     ready, so it cannot depend on any. Every animated property returns to its
2641	     starting value at 100%, which is what makes the loop seamless rather than
2642	     snapping back on repeat.
2643	
2644	     Sized against --nx-chrome, same as .nx-shell-root/.nx-appframe. It used to
2645	     be a bare `min-h-[68vh]` Tailwind class — 68% of the true viewport height,
2646	     with no idea that the sandbox banner and the sticky header already sit
2647	     above it in flow. On the sandbox that extra ~28px plus the header was
2648	     sometimes enough to push the whole document past 100dvh, so the page
2649	     scrolled and the mark centred itself in a box taller than the visible
2650	     area instead of the viewport. */
2651	  .nx-pre { min-height: calc(68dvh - var(--nx-chrome)); }
